"陳敏","start":180,"end":182,"person_id":"kok_m7n_tux","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-058-zhou-qi:p002:m0188","surface":"圮","start":188,"end":189,"person_id":"i1w_a4z_a3g","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-058-zhou-qi:p002:m0194","surface":"趙驡","start":194,"end":196,"person_id":"t1w_jaz_tch","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-058-zhou-qi:p002:m0202","surface":"玘","start":202,"end":203,"person_id":"i1w_a4z_a3g","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-058-zhou-qi:p002:m0215","surface":"封雲","start":215,"end":217,"person_id":"mnr_35c_4aa","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-058-zhou-qi:p002:m0221","surface":"張統","start":221,"end":223,"person_id":"hue_jgf_fqb","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-058-zhou-qi:p002:m0226","surface":"冰","start":226,"end":227,"person_id":"doi_z86_qc2","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-058-zhou-qi:p002:m0236","surface":"玘","start":236,"end":237,"person_id":"i1w_a4z_a3g","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-058-zhou-qi","book_id":"b-jinshu-058","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-058-zhou-qi-ws1775463"},{"id":"c-jinshu-066-liuhong:p001","text":"劉弘，字和季，沛國相人也。祖馥，魏揚州刺史。父靖，鎮北將軍。弘有幹略政事之才，少家洛陽，與武帝同居永安裏，又同年，共研席。以舊恩起家太子門大夫，累遷率更令，轉太宰長史。張華甚重之。由是為甯朔將軍、假節、監幽州諸軍事，領烏丸校尉，甚有威惠，寇盜屏跡，為幽朔所稱。以勳德兼茂，封宣城公。太安中，張昌作亂，轉使持節、南蠻校尉、荊州刺史，率前將軍趙驤等討昌，自方城至宛、新野，所向皆平。及新野王歆之敗也，以弘代為鎮南將軍、都督荊州諸軍事，餘官如故。弘遣南蠻長史陶侃為大都護，參軍蒯恆為義軍督護，牙門將皮初為都戰帥，進據襄陽。張昌並軍圍宛，敗趙驤軍，弘退屯梁。侃、初等累戰破昌，前後斬首數萬級。及到官，昌懼而逃，其眾悉降，荊土平。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":10,"last_line":10,"raw_start":159,"raw_end":471,"raw_character_offsets":[161,162,163,164,165,166,167,168,169,170,171,172,173,174,175,176,177,178,179,180,181,182,183,184,185,186,187,188,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199,200,201,202,203